message: >-
  AVEngine does not yet have a released paper or DOI. Cite the pinned software
  version and the upstream Habitat and SoundSpaces works listed in CITATIONS.bib.
type: software
title: "AVEngine: room-routed audiovisual dataset engine"
abstract: >-
  Private research software for deterministic, identity-preserving audiovisual
  episode generation with Habitat-Sim, RLR and room-specific UE/SPEAR visual
  execution. Source integration and dataset claims retain their stated evidence
  boundaries.
